{
  "slug": "srclight",
  "name": "Srclight",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deep code indexing for AI agents. Gives Claude Code structural understanding of entire codebases — symbol search, call graphs, type hierarchies, git blame/hotspots, dead code detection, and semantic search. 28 MCP tools across 11 languages (Python, JS/TS, C, C++, C#, Java, Kotlin, Go, Swift, Dart, PHP). Fully local, zero telemetry, MIT licensed.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `codebase-indexing` (This skill should be used when srclight MCP tools are available and the user asks to \"search for…), `explore-codebase` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"explore this codebase\", \"understand this project\", \"give me…), `refactor-safely` (This skill should be used when the user asks to \"refactor\", \"rename\", \"move\", \"change a function signature\", \"extract…), `setup` (Set up srclight for code indexing)\n- **Agents** (1): `codebase-explorer` (Use this agent for deep, autonomous codebase research that requires multiple search rounds, call graph traversal, and cross-file…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `srclight`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install srclight@claude-community` from `srclight/claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
